# SPA fallback for the Syllabus Tracker's client-only deep links
# (/syllabus-tracker/htet, /syllabus-tracker/htet/level-1-prt, ...), and the
# same for its Hindi/Marathi mirrors (/hi/syllabus-tracker/*, /mr/syllabus-tracker/*).
# src/app/syllabus-tracker/page.tsx (and its hi/mr mirrors) are single,
# non-dynamic pages — those nested paths are never real Next routes (real
# exam/level slugs come from a live backend, unknowable at build time), they
# only ever exist via SyllabusTrackerApp pushing/replacing the URL with the
# raw History API. A hard reload or a shared link at one of those paths has
# no matching static file, so Cloudflare Pages would 404 without this: it
# rewrites any of them back to the one built page for that locale with a 200
# (not a redirect), keeping the URL bar intact, and
# src/lib/syllabusTrackerUrl.ts then parses window.location client-side to
# restore the right step. Paths are upstream-relative (no /tools prefix) —
# apps/tools/worker/src/index.ts strips /tools (and /hi/tools, /mr/tools)
# before proxying here, per CLAUDE.md's "apps/tools deployment" section.
/syllabus-tracker/*     /syllabus-tracker     200
/hi/syllabus-tracker/*  /hi/syllabus-tracker  200
/mr/syllabus-tracker/*  /mr/syllabus-tracker  200
